{"id":"627018","name":"柠檬凤爪","author":"小洞天","authorId":"126119","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/627018/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡爪","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"柠檬","amount":"1个"},{"name":"冰块","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"将鸡爪收拾干净，剪掉指甲。","img":"images/627018/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"改刀成小块，冷水下锅，放葱姜料酒。","img":"images/627018/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"开锅后撇去浮沫，改小火煮30分钟。","img":"images/627018/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出冲洗干净。","img":"images/627018/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入冰块，至冰块融化。","img":"images/627018/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"沥干水分。","img":"images/627018/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入盐、白糖、柠檬片、小米椒、蒜片、香菜段。","img":"images/627018/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入生抽。","img":"images/627018/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"少许老抽。","img":"images/627018/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放一勺蚝油，一勺花椒油。","img":"images/627018/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"抓拌均匀，盖上保鲜膜。","img":"images/627018/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放冰箱冷藏2小时以上。","img":"images/627018/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/627018/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"柠檬切成薄片，去籽，否则发苦。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}